    "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><title>Easy Crêpe-Style Pancakes | Example Kitchen</title><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Recipe\", \"name\": \"Easy Crêpe-Style Pancakes\", \"description\": \"Thin pancakes for a lazy breakfast.\", \"recipeYield\": \"Serves 2 (makes 8)\", \"totalTime\": \"PT20M\", \"recipeIngredient\": [\"100 g plain flour\", \"2 large eggs\", \"300 ml whole milk\", \"1 tbsp butter, melted, plus extra for the pan\", \"a pinch of salt\"], \"recipeInstructions\": [{\"@type\": \"HowToStep\", \"text\": \"Whisk the flour, eggs, milk and salt until smooth.\"}, {\"@type\": \"HowToStep\", \"text\": \"Stir in the melted butter.\"}, {\"@type\": \"HowToStep\", \"text\": \"Cook thin pancakes in a hot buttered pan, about 1 minute a side.\"}], \"image\": [\"https://example.com/photo.jpg\"], \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Jo\"}, \"aggregateRating\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateRating\", \"ratingValue\": \"4.8\"}}</script></head><body><header><nav><a href='/'>Home</a> <a href='/recipes'>Recipes</a> <a href='/about'>About</a></nav></header><div class='ad'>ADVERTISEMENT - Subscribe to our newsletter!</div><article><h1>Easy Crêpe-Style Pancakes</h1><p>Thin pancakes for a lazy breakfast.</p><p>There is something about this dish that takes me straight back to my grandmother&#x27;s kitchen. Before we get to it, a word from our sponsor: 20% off cast-iron pans this week! I have made this more times than I can count, tweaking it over the years.</p><p class='meta'>Serves 2 (makes 8)</p><h2>Ingredients</h2><ul><li>100 g plain flour</li><li>2 large eggs</li><li>300 ml whole milk</li><li>1 tbsp butter, melted, plus extra for the pan</li><li>a pinch of salt</li></ul><div class='ad'>ADVERTISEMENT</div><h2>Method</h2><ol><li>Whisk the flour, eggs, milk and salt until smooth.</li><li>Stir in the melted butter.</li><li>Cook thin pancakes in a hot buttered pan, about 1 minute a side.</li></ol></article><section class='comments'><h3>Comments</h3><p>Made this tonight, loved it! - Sam</p></section><footer>© Example Kitchen. Privacy. Cookies.</footer></body></html>",
