ng soda</li><li>1 1/2 cups all-purpose flour</li><li>Pinch of salt</li></ul><div class='ad'>ADVERTISEMENT</div><h2>Method</h2><ol><li>Heat the oven to 175C and butter a loaf tin.</li><li>Mix the bananas and melted butter.</li><li>Stir in the sugar, egg and vanilla, then the baking soda, salt and flour.</li><li>Bake for 55-60 minutes until a skewer comes out clean.</li></ol></article><section class='comments'><h3>Comments</h3><p>Made this tonight, loved it! - Sam</p></section><footer>© Example Kitchen. Privacy. Cookies.</footer></body></html>",
